        <item>
            <title>0.27.13</title>
            <pubDate>Tue, 03 Nov 2026 16:31:07 -0600</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>74</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.27.13</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <description><![CDATA[<style>:root{color-scheme:light dark}body{font:13px/1.45 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,system-ui,sans-serif;color:#1d1d1f;margin:0;padding:2px 4px}h3{font-size:13px;font-weight:600;margin:0 0 6px}ul{margin:0;padding-left:18px}li{margin:0 0 4px}code{font:12px ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace}@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark){body{color:#f5f5f7}}</style><h3>What's new in Keeploop 0.27.13</h3><ul><li>Slack monitors no longer go quiet after Keeploop restarts or updates. Keeploop used to read your Slack history again on every start, and monitors could miss new messages until it caught up. It now keeps its copy across restarts.</li></ul>]]></description>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
